{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51265","headline":"小桃源 · 李白","name":"小桃源","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黟县小桃源，烟霞百里间。\n地多灵草木，人尚古衣冠。\n市向晡前散，山经夜後寒。\n（《舆地纪胜》二十《徯州》载此诗六句，注云见《龙城志》。\n《锦绣节花谷》亦载此诗，以爲太白作。\n王琦按：「此诗乃南唐许坚诗，其後小有二韵。\n」今按：已从《舆地纪胜》补其一韵。\n又按：《全唐诗》七五七及八六一两见许坚，皆未收此诗。\n〖本书卷十五又笖此诗於许坚名下，凡八句。\n今仍两存之。\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51265.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51265","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}